WEBVTT

00:03.790 --> 00:05.380
<b>This is Kumota.</b>

00:05.750 --> 00:07.790
<b>He's your invincible guy?</b>

00:09.000 --> 00:10.500
<b>You sure about that?</b>

00:11.130 --> 00:12.830
<b>What do you think, Nakao?</b>

00:15.540 --> 00:17.580
<b><i>What's with him?</i></b>

00:17.670 --> 00:21.210
<b><i>He's giving off something,</i>
<i>but it's not bloodlust.</i></b>

00:22.380 --> 00:24.540
<b>I'd say he knows what he's doing.</b>

00:24.920 --> 00:26.330
<b>That right?</b>

00:26.670 --> 00:28.250
<b>Okay, go ahead.</b>

00:37.000 --> 00:38.960
<b>G-Gunshots?</b>

00:43.460 --> 00:44.460
<b>A-Aniki!</b>

00:45.130 --> 00:47.580
<b>What happened out there?</b>

00:48.290 --> 00:50.210
<b>Hey, I found them.</b>

01:05.630 --> 01:06.830
<b>Boss!</b>

01:08.920 --> 01:10.670
<b>Son of a bitch!</b>

01:11.500 --> 01:14.040
<b>You boys take the boss and get out of here!</b>

01:14.130 --> 01:15.080
<b>A-Aniki?!</b>

01:15.710 --> 01:16.960
<b>Dammit!</b>

01:20.500 --> 01:21.750
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

01:21.790 --> 01:22.960
<b>Shit!</b>

01:23.000 --> 01:24.170
<b>Forget those chumps.</b>

01:24.250 --> 01:26.130
<b>We need to find the stuff.</b>

01:26.920 --> 01:28.250
<b>Got the money.</b>

01:29.000 --> 01:30.250
<b>And here's the merch!</b>

01:30.500 --> 01:32.000
<b>Good. Let's get out of here.</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Boss...</b>

03:11.630 --> 03:12.960
<b>Aniki!</b>

03:13.250 --> 03:15.250
<b>Wh-What the hell was that?</b>

03:15.670 --> 03:18.330
<b>The kind of robbery that
doesn't involve Shocker.</b>

03:20.960 --> 03:24.790
<b>You boys take this and get some yakinuku.</b>

03:24.880 --> 03:26.000
<b>Aniki?</b>

03:27.420 --> 03:29.580
<b>I'm not backing off after what happened.</b>

03:31.210 --> 03:33.250
<b>You need to get out of here!</b>

03:33.330 --> 03:35.170
<b>I'll meet up with you later.</b>

03:38.540 --> 03:40.500
<b>Wh-Why...?</b>

03:40.580 --> 03:42.830
<b>Why isn't he dead?!</b>

03:53.630 --> 03:55.080
<b>Fine, then.</b>

04:08.710 --> 04:09.710
<b>No way...</b>

04:14.750 --> 04:16.380
<b>Shocker?</b>

04:26.540 --> 04:28.170
<b>M...M...</b>

04:28.750 --> 04:30.380
<b>Monster...</b>

04:34.790 --> 04:38.500
<b><i>Why's this all coming back to me now?</i></b>

04:40.250 --> 04:43.630
<b><i>I guess it's my life flashing before my eyes.</i></b>

04:48.670 --> 04:50.500
<b>Go, Rider!</b>

04:50.540 --> 04:52.790
<b>Kick Shocker's butt!</b>

04:53.790 --> 04:56.880
<b>Yeah! Rider beat Shocker!</b>

04:57.830 --> 04:59.460
<b>Hey, Hachiro.</b>

04:59.540 --> 05:01.380
<b>It's finally ready!</b>

05:02.670 --> 05:05.460
<b>This taiyaki recipe is gonna be my big break.</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:07.790
<b>Just try it.</b>

05:14.210 --> 05:16.880
<b>Dad, it's really good!</b>

05:16.960 --> 05:20.210
<b>It's nothing like the others I've made, right?</b>

05:21.830 --> 05:25.750
<b>I made the dough thin and filled it
from head to tail with red bean paste!</b>

05:25.830 --> 05:26.960
<b>Hey, you're right!</b>

05:27.040 --> 05:30.330
<b>See, I actually used cream puff dough.</b>

05:31.040 --> 05:34.210
<b>Even ordered a custom mold
to keep it as thin as possible!</b>

05:34.290 --> 05:36.080
<b>That set me back 1.2 million yen.</b>

05:37.500 --> 05:41.790
<b>You cook it real fast, like a crepe,
to get the crispy texture,</b>

05:41.880 --> 05:45.750
<b>then fill it to the brim with bean
paste that's even smoother than usual!</b>

05:46.210 --> 05:51.500
<b>They're a little smaller than average
to account for the extra cost, but...</b>

05:53.250 --> 05:58.130
<b>When you eat it, you get
a mouthful of red bean paradise!</b>

05:59.500 --> 06:02.630
<b>It's like spending a sweet moment
with the princess of red beans!</b>

06:03.380 --> 06:05.630
<b>Who the heck's that?</b>

06:07.000 --> 06:08.960
<b>If this works out...</b>

06:10.000 --> 06:12.920
<b>Maybe your mom'll come back.</b>

06:13.790 --> 06:15.830
<b>Yeah! It could happen!</b>

06:15.920 --> 06:17.630
<b>I bet she'll come back to us!</b>

06:17.710 --> 06:18.630
<b>Really?!</b>

06:18.710 --> 06:19.710
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:20.790 --> 06:24.210
<b>I'm calling this bad boy the
Super Stuffed Red Bean Taiyaki.</b>

06:24.290 --> 06:25.880
<b>It's our ticket to a bright future!</b>

06:25.960 --> 06:29.540
<b>And will you buy me the Kamen Rider
transformation toys if it is?</b>

06:29.630 --> 06:31.750
<b>Yeah! Anything you want!</b>

06:31.830 --> 06:33.210
<b>Yay!</b>

06:33.290 --> 06:35.000
<b>I even thought up a catchphrase.</b>

06:35.080 --> 06:36.080
<b>What is it?</b>

06:36.580 --> 06:37.750
<b>Goes like this...</b>

06:37.830 --> 06:41.670
<b>Life's just like red bean paste—you
gotta enjoy it from end to end!</b>

06:42.080 --> 06:43.750
<b>Sounds good!</b>

06:43.830 --> 06:47.170
<b>Right?! This thing's bound to sell like crazy!</b>

06:49.500 --> 06:50.420
<b>SUPER STUFFED RED BEAN TAIYAKI</b>

06:50.500 --> 06:51.500
<b>LIFE'S JUST LIKE RED BEAN PASTE
GOTTA ENJOY IT FROM END TO END!</b>

06:57.170 --> 06:58.630
<b>Dad...</b>

06:58.710 --> 07:03.420
<b>Life's just like red bean paste.
Gotta enjoy it from end to end...</b>

07:05.170 --> 07:07.670
<b>I'm sure you'll sell some tomorrow!</b>

07:10.170 --> 07:11.710
<b>You're probably right.</b>

07:15.170 --> 07:17.670
<b>TASTY TAIYAKI!</b>

07:32.920 --> 07:34.420
<b>It's done!</b>

07:34.500 --> 07:36.040
<b>I'm home.</b>

07:36.710 --> 07:38.290
<b>Welcome home!</b>

07:40.210 --> 07:43.500
<b>Check it out, Dad! I made this myself.</b>

07:46.080 --> 07:50.670
<b>Hachiro... I'm not selling taiyaki anymore.</b>

07:50.750 --> 07:53.080
<b>I'm gonna be moving in with this lady.</b>

07:53.580 --> 07:55.500
<b>Who... Who is she?</b>

07:55.580 --> 07:59.420
<b>See, your sorry excuse for a debt-ridden dad</b>

07:59.500 --> 08:02.330
<b>is going to be my fifth dog.</b>

08:03.210 --> 08:05.130
<b>"Dog"? What?</b>

08:05.500 --> 08:08.750
<b>Dad? What's she talking about?</b>

08:08.830 --> 08:12.170
<b>It... It's just what it sounds like.</b>

08:12.250 --> 08:15.540
<b>Since I'd feel bad if your dad
up and vanished on you,</b>

08:15.630 --> 08:17.960
<b>I brought him here to make things clear.</b>

08:23.630 --> 08:25.210
<b>I'm heading home first.</b>

08:25.290 --> 08:26.460
<b>R-Right.</b>

08:26.540 --> 08:28.580
<b>D-Dad?</b>

08:30.080 --> 08:33.250
<b>Please, don't ask for any details.</b>

08:33.670 --> 08:36.130
<b>This will get rid of my debt!</b>

08:36.540 --> 08:38.960
<b>Go stay with Grandpa.</b>

08:40.420 --> 08:42.790
<b>Dad, wait!</b>

08:46.080 --> 08:50.920
<b>Dad!</b>

08:58.920 --> 09:00.790
<b>I get to be Rider today!</b>

09:00.880 --> 09:02.290
<b>No way! I wanna do it!</b>

09:02.380 --> 09:03.960
<b>Not happening! It's my turn!</b>

09:04.000 --> 09:06.500
<b>Then who's gonna be Shocker?</b>

09:07.290 --> 09:08.250
<b>Hey.</b>

09:08.790 --> 09:10.960
<b>Oh, you're the kid from the city.</b>

09:11.040 --> 09:12.210
<b>Nakao, right?</b>

09:12.790 --> 09:15.210
<b>You wanna play Rider, too?</b>

09:16.540 --> 09:19.130
<b>Why do you all wanna be Rider?</b>

09:19.210 --> 09:23.000
<b>Because he's the good guy! Duh!</b>

09:23.080 --> 09:24.380
<b>I mean, he's a superhero!</b>

09:24.460 --> 09:27.250
<b>And he lands those cool kicks!</b>

09:29.250 --> 09:30.460
<b>There's no such thing.</b>

09:31.670 --> 09:33.630
<b>I'll be Shocker.</b>

09:34.460 --> 09:37.040
<b>So you guys can all be Riders.</b>

09:38.210 --> 09:40.670
<b>What are you even talking about?</b>

09:41.790 --> 09:44.080
<b>I can be Shocker by myself.</b>

09:44.170 --> 09:46.250
<b>You know you've got it backwards, right?</b>

09:47.040 --> 09:49.960
<b>Rider helps the weak, after all!</b>

09:50.040 --> 09:52.960
<b>He protects everyone from monsters!</b>

09:58.000 --> 09:58.960
<b>What?!</b>

09:59.040 --> 10:00.790
<b>Check it out, he's crying!</b>

10:00.880 --> 10:04.130
<b>Whoa, what's wrong, new kid?</b>

10:04.750 --> 10:07.880
<b><i>My Dad... tried so hard...</i></b>

10:08.750 --> 10:11.750
<b><i>Did everything he could,</i>
<i>but it still didn't work out...</i></b>

10:12.830 --> 10:14.380
<b><i>And in the end...</i></b>

10:15.500 --> 10:19.290
<b><i>no one helped my dad and me.</i></b>

10:20.380 --> 10:26.500
<b>Listen to me! There's no such thing
as good guys or superheroes!</b>

10:28.250 --> 10:31.380
<b>Which is why I'm gonna be Shocker.</b>

10:31.960 --> 10:36.920
<b>Then I'll be strong enough to live on
my own without anyone's help!</b>

10:38.540 --> 10:40.670
<b>Now, prepare yourselves, Rider scum!</b>

10:44.920 --> 10:48.460
<b><i>That's right.</i></b>

10:51.710 --> 10:57.040
<b>H-Hey... you're a Shocker monster, right?</b>

10:58.170 --> 10:59.540
<b>In that case...</b>

11:00.540 --> 11:04.330
<b>Let me join Shocker.</b>

11:05.130 --> 11:06.290
<b>Please?</b>

11:07.210 --> 11:11.130
<b>LET ME JOIN SHOCKER
Please let me join Shocker!</b>

11:27.460 --> 11:29.710
<b>THAT FAMOUS FLAVOR YAKINIKU HOUSE</b>

11:42.630 --> 11:45.250
<b>Do you think Aniki's okay?</b>

11:45.710 --> 11:48.960
<b>I forgot. Got distracted by the meat...</b>

11:49.040 --> 11:50.210
<b>Me too.</b>

11:50.500 --> 11:53.670
<b>I mean, I just remembered now, too...</b>

11:54.040 --> 11:57.880
<b>But, y'know, I guess we have to wait.
So we might as well chow down.</b>

11:58.670 --> 12:00.080
<b>True.</b>

12:09.170 --> 12:10.250
<b>Where am I?</b>

12:12.250 --> 12:15.630
<b>I thought... I died?</b>

12:27.540 --> 12:29.880
<b>Man, what a meal!</b>

12:29.960 --> 12:31.960
<b>That was like a year's worth of food.</b>

12:32.040 --> 12:33.250
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:34.630 --> 12:36.750
<b>- Aniki?!
- Hey.</b>

12:36.830 --> 12:38.540
<b>You're okay?!</b>

12:38.630 --> 12:40.250
<b>And damn, that's a lot of blood!</b>

12:40.330 --> 12:43.210
<b>Believe it or not, I'm totally fine.</b>

12:43.290 --> 12:47.170
<b>The weird thing is, I'm having trouble
remembering what happened.</b>

12:47.250 --> 12:48.710
<b>Excuse me.</b>

12:48.790 --> 12:52.960
<b>We're closing in 30 minutes.
Is it all right if I handle the tab?</b>

12:53.040 --> 12:55.080
<b>Oh, sure. How much?</b>

12:55.830 --> 12:58.380
<b>295,800 yen.</b>

12:58.750 --> 13:01.250
<b>295 thou?!</b>

13:03.130 --> 13:05.130
<b>Here's your mil, Aniki.</b>

13:05.830 --> 13:09.380
<b>In that case... there's 300 thou.</b>

13:09.460 --> 13:11.250
<b>Keep the change.</b>

13:11.330 --> 13:13.380
<b>No, sir, I'll bring your change.</b>

13:14.460 --> 13:16.500
<b>Boys, I gotta ask...</b>

13:16.580 --> 13:20.380
<b>Who in the hell eats 300k worth of yakinku?</b>

13:20.460 --> 13:23.960
<b>Well, Aniki, we were trying
to eat the whole mil's worth!</b>

13:24.040 --> 13:25.250
<b>Don't be stupid!</b>

13:26.880 --> 13:28.420
<b>I guess it's fine, though.</b>

13:28.500 --> 13:31.880
<b>Not like there's a lotta good to come
from working with me.</b>

13:32.290 --> 13:35.040
<b>We're just happy to work for you, Aniki!</b>

13:35.130 --> 13:36.040
<b>Right?</b>

13:36.130 --> 13:37.040
<b>Yessir!</b>

13:37.130 --> 13:39.040
<b>What a load of crap.</b>

13:40.130 --> 13:43.920
<b>But, man, I could have sworn...</b>

13:46.630 --> 13:48.040
<b>Remember that?</b>

13:49.250 --> 13:50.380
<b>What the heck?</b>

13:51.380 --> 13:54.710
<b>Aniki! You're Shocker now!</b>

13:57.330 --> 13:58.790
<b>What the heck happened?</b>

13:59.210 --> 14:00.830
<b>How in the world did you end up in Shocker?</b>

14:00.920 --> 14:04.750
<b>That'd be the part I don't remember at all.</b>

14:05.880 --> 14:07.000
<b>Aniki!</b>

14:07.380 --> 14:10.080
<b>We're kinda standing out, y'know?</b>

14:10.170 --> 14:12.750
<b>Can you, like, change back to normal?</b>

14:12.830 --> 14:14.420
<b>Good question.</b>

14:14.880 --> 14:16.210
<b>Return!</b>

14:17.920 --> 14:20.000
<b>Holy shit! That was awesome!</b>

14:20.080 --> 14:23.460
<b>Aniki, can you change into Shocker form again?!</b>

14:26.460 --> 14:28.750
<b>Shocker!</b>

14:32.080 --> 14:33.500
<b>You can totally control it!</b>

14:33.580 --> 14:35.630
<b>How's that work with, like, your clothes?!</b>

14:35.710 --> 14:37.960
<b>It's Shocker tech.</b>

14:39.960 --> 14:42.960
<b>I think I must've died.</b>

14:43.460 --> 14:46.080
<b>And when I woke up again,
I was part of Shocker.</b>

14:46.170 --> 14:47.460
<b>For real?!</b>

14:48.920 --> 14:53.460
<b><i>Should I say that my</i>
<i>childhood dream's come true?</i></b>

14:53.920 --> 14:56.500
<b>Aniki, transform again!</b>

14:56.580 --> 15:00.130
<b>"Transform"?
Come on, that's Kamen Rider stuff.</b>

15:00.210 --> 15:01.710
<b>But if you insist...</b>

15:01.790 --> 15:04.000
<b>You seem kinda happy!</b>

15:04.830 --> 15:08.040
<b>I dunno if I've ever seen you this glad before.</b>

15:08.710 --> 15:10.790
<b>Don't be stupid.</b>

15:11.790 --> 15:13.330
<b>Hold on, hold on...</b>

15:13.420 --> 15:14.710
<b>Dude, you're not the one doing it.</b>

15:14.750 --> 15:15.750
<b>Heat of the moment.</b>

15:15.830 --> 15:17.380
<b>I get it, though.</b>

15:17.460 --> 15:19.040
<b>You boys...</b>

15:21.040 --> 15:23.460
<b>This is how the real deal does it.</b>

15:25.170 --> 15:27.710
<b>Aniki, you're so badass!</b>

15:28.500 --> 15:31.080
<b>I'm about 120 kilos.</b>

15:31.170 --> 15:33.540
<b>Do you think you could
carry me like a princess?</b>

15:35.080 --> 15:36.500
<b>Sure can.</b>

15:37.210 --> 15:38.630
<b>That's awesome!</b>

15:38.710 --> 15:39.920
<b>Do us, too!</b>

15:40.960 --> 15:43.040
<b>Dammit, not all at once!</b>

15:46.540 --> 15:48.080
<b>Are you tired?</b>

15:48.170 --> 15:49.290
<b>Lil' bit.</b>

15:49.380 --> 15:52.130
<b>You wanna grab something sweet to eat?</b>

15:52.210 --> 15:54.460
<b>You just ate a ton of yakiniku!</b>

15:54.500 --> 15:56.790
<b>Desserts go to a different stomach!</b>

15:56.880 --> 16:00.130
<b>I happen to have some taiyaki I bought, too!</b>

16:00.960 --> 16:02.330
<b>Man...</b>

16:03.130 --> 16:05.000
<b>Say, Aniki...</b>

16:06.540 --> 16:09.540
<b>I was scarfing down yakiniku,
so I kinda forgot, but...</b>

16:09.920 --> 16:12.960
<b>what's gonna happen to our gang now?</b>

16:14.750 --> 16:18.170
<b>Well, that was our boss
that got killed in the raid today.</b>

16:18.670 --> 16:20.250
<b>Most likely... it'll be dissolved.</b>

16:21.380 --> 16:23.960
<b>I'm still willing to work for you!</b>

16:24.040 --> 16:25.670
<b>Likewise!</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:30.130
<b>Let's eat these while they're hot.</b>

16:31.880 --> 16:33.630
<b>- So good!
- What is this?!</b>

16:33.710 --> 16:35.040
<b>It's way too good!</b>

16:35.750 --> 16:37.040
<b>You boys...</b>

16:38.960 --> 16:41.000
<b>oughta be civvies from now on.</b>

16:42.750 --> 16:44.040
<b>We don't wanna.</b>

16:45.210 --> 16:47.420
<b>We don't wanna! No matter what!</b>

16:47.500 --> 16:48.460
<b>Hear me out.</b>

16:48.540 --> 16:51.500
<b>All things end, sooner or later.</b>

16:51.540 --> 16:53.670
<b>No matter what we do.</b>

16:54.330 --> 16:58.830
<b>Sometimes that ending...
can mean your life ending, too.</b>

16:58.920 --> 17:01.670
<b>But you guys are still young!</b>

17:01.960 --> 17:04.460
<b>You can start over—</b>

17:04.540 --> 17:08.290
<b>We're going to follow you
wherever you go, Aniki!</b>

17:17.170 --> 17:18.290
<b>This is...</b>

17:18.790 --> 17:20.080
<b>Where'd you buy this?!</b>

17:21.460 --> 17:22.960
<b>That stand over there.</b>

17:27.170 --> 17:31.250
<b>And I'm asking what the hell
you think you're doing here!</b>

17:31.330 --> 17:35.750
<b>Sir, I asked your group for permission...</b>

17:37.330 --> 17:41.920
<b>Wait.. you're that dude
from the Matsunoshita-gumi.</b>

17:42.290 --> 17:43.210
<b>Who're you?</b>

17:43.290 --> 17:45.330
<b>Don't play dumb.</b>

17:45.420 --> 17:49.330
<b>You're Nakao, the guy who beat on
five guys in the street ten years ago.</b>

17:49.420 --> 17:51.750
<b>Can't say I remember.</b>

17:51.830 --> 17:54.830
<b>Well, I was one of those five, dumbass!</b>

17:55.960 --> 17:57.790
<b>LIFE'S JUST LIKE RED BEAN PASTE
GOTTA ENJOY IT FROM END TO END!
I knew it.</b>

17:58.080 --> 17:59.420
<b>Excuse me.</b>

17:59.830 --> 18:03.040
<b>Please don't fight in front of my business.</b>

18:03.710 --> 18:05.170
<b><i>Dad...</i></b>

18:06.540 --> 18:11.210
<b><i>It's been decades.</i>
<i>No telling what he's been through...</i></b>

18:11.290 --> 18:14.500
<b><i>And now he's selling taiyaki again?</i></b>

18:16.500 --> 18:19.290
<b><i>I never had any dreams or hope.</i></b>

18:19.380 --> 18:23.670
<b><i>No, I just thought that I didn't need them.</i></b>

18:25.000 --> 18:28.960
<b><i>But you never gave up, did you, Dad?</i></b>

18:35.880 --> 18:36.830
<b>Knock it off!</b>

18:36.920 --> 18:37.960
<b>Butt out!</b>

18:38.040 --> 18:42.790
<b>It's the old bastard's fault
for doing business on our turf!</b>

18:42.880 --> 18:47.170
<b>I-I-It's not that! I got permission
from the Matsunoshita-gumi!</b>

18:47.250 --> 18:49.460
<b>That outfit is history!</b>

18:49.960 --> 18:52.880
<b>I see. The raid...</b>

18:52.960 --> 18:55.500
<b>That was your people, wasn't it?</b>

18:56.080 --> 18:57.790
<b>Hell if I know.</b>

18:58.290 --> 19:02.500
<b>Word of advice. My gang isn't history.</b>

19:04.290 --> 19:06.130
<b>Because I'm still here!</b>

19:06.790 --> 19:08.000
<b>Then...</b>

19:08.420 --> 19:10.830
<b>You die, too!</b>

19:15.250 --> 19:17.460
<b>Gotta love a bat.</b>

19:17.540 --> 19:20.580
<b>Even if the cops get on your case,</b>

19:20.670 --> 19:24.000
<b>you can say you're off to play baseball!</b>

19:25.540 --> 19:27.210
<b>Y-Yamahiko!</b>

19:28.080 --> 19:30.960
<b>He's the one! Get his ass!</b>

19:32.540 --> 19:33.960
<b>All right.</b>

19:34.460 --> 19:36.000
<b>B-Boys...</b>

19:36.630 --> 19:39.880
<b>We puked up all the yakinku...</b>

19:42.500 --> 19:45.000
<b>You first!</b>

19:47.420 --> 19:48.670
<b>Bring it on!</b>

19:48.750 --> 19:50.960
<b>Son of a—</b>

19:59.830 --> 20:00.920
<b>Aniki!</b>

20:02.790 --> 20:04.920
<b>Huh? You getting up?</b>

20:07.210 --> 20:09.960
<b>So, what did you used to do?</b>

20:11.130 --> 20:12.710
<b>I was a pro wrestler.</b>

20:13.040 --> 20:15.080
<b>Well, shit.</b>

20:15.170 --> 20:18.330
<b>Pro wrestling. I'm a fan—</b>

20:18.830 --> 20:20.210
<b>Yeah?</b>

20:23.460 --> 20:28.080
<b>My dream... was this.</b>

20:28.170 --> 20:31.630
<b>Just die already!</b>

20:39.040 --> 20:40.540
<b>What the—</b>

20:42.420 --> 20:43.420
<b>This...</b>

20:43.880 --> 20:46.080
<b>This is a—</b>

20:46.670 --> 20:49.460
<b>Tiger Driver!</b>

20:53.540 --> 20:54.460
<b>Listen...</b>

20:54.540 --> 20:56.040
<b>Y-Yes?</b>

20:56.580 --> 20:59.540
<b>You can turn these two in to the cops.</b>

20:59.630 --> 21:03.580
<b>And you're all good to sell your stuff here.</b>

21:03.670 --> 21:05.920
<b>Th-Thank you.</b>

21:06.290 --> 21:10.540
<b>And... I had some of your taiyaki, mister.</b>

21:11.460 --> 21:16.040
<b>Something nostalgic about
how it tastes... It was really good.</b>

21:17.420 --> 21:20.500
<b>And... uh, well...</b>

21:21.830 --> 21:25.420
<b>Take care of yourself. And good luck.</b>

21:26.580 --> 21:29.540
<b>Um... wh-who are you?</b>

21:36.960 --> 21:40.540
<b>Just a Shocker combatant
who was passing through!</b>

21:41.170 --> 21:44.460
<b>A SHOCKER HERO APPEARS?!
CHASING OFF FOOD TRUCK ASSAILANTS!</b>

21:45.920 --> 21:48.710
<b>"A Shocker hero appears"?!</b>

21:48.960 --> 21:51.080
<b>A Shocker... hero?</b>

21:51.960 --> 21:54.960
<b>No, no, no, no, no, no!</b>

23:24.960 --> 23:27.040
<b>NEXT TIME</b>

23:30.330 --> 23:32.500
<b>WHEN FACED</b>

23:32.540 --> 23:34.000
<b>WITH A FIERCE FOE</b>

23:34.080 --> 23:36.500
<b>WHAT</b>

23:36.580 --> 23:38.880
<b>WILL KAMEN RIDER DO?</b>

23:38.960 --> 23:39.920
<b>WHEN FACED WITH A FIERCE FOE,
WHAT WILL KAMEN RIDER DO?</b>

23:39.960 --> 23:43.920
<b>ILLUSTRATION BY: SENNSU</b>

23:43.960 --> 23:49.960
<b>ILLUSTRATION BY: SENNSU</b>
